course: dictionary
lesson: 7889
title: Words with more than one meaning
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. The context, meaning the words and sentences around the word, tells you which meaning the writer wants. Ranger is one of these words.
explain: «Rangers and scientists study droppings to learn which animals live in a place.» Here the clues are park, animals and study, so a ranger is someone who looks after wild places and their animals. Check it by swapping in your meaning: a person who looks after wild places still makes sense.
explain: In a story, the clues change. A ranger might be someone who wanders and guards wild lands, with no job title at all. Always ask: what does the sentence tell me about this word?
fact: A ranger is a person whose job is to look after a park, forest or wild area.
fact: Rangers protect the animals and plants in a park, and they help and guide visitors.
fact: In some armies, a ranger is a specially trained soldier.
fact: If you are lost or hurt in a national park, find a ranger.
fact: Phrases with ranger: park ranger, forest ranger, ranger station, junior ranger.
exercise: «Every kakapo has a name and is watched by rangers.» What do rangers do with the kakapo? | Turn it into a cartoon hero | Sell it to zoos | *Watch it and look after it | Hide it from visitors
exercise: You are lost in a national park. Who should you find for help? | A shop keeper selling snacks | *A ranger | A cartoon hero | A poacher
exercise: In a story, what is a ranger? | *Someone who wanders and guards wild lands | A type of dog | A kind of bird | A petrol station worker
test: «Rangers and scientists study droppings to learn which animals live in a place and what they eat.» What do they learn? | How fast animals can run | *Which animals live in a place and what they eat | The colour of the sky | How old the trees are
test: Where would you go in a park to get help from a ranger? | A sweet shop | *A ranger station | A zoo café | A cartoon studio
exam: Ella is lost in a forest park and sees a sign saying Ranger Station. What should she do? | Keep walking alone in the dark | Feed the wild animals to calm them | *Go to the ranger station and ask for help | Hide until it rains
